<title>USA: Ira Food Brokers says to acquire Servac.</title>
<headline>Ira Food Brokers says to acquire Servac.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH-DURHAM, N.C. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ira Food Brokers Inc said on Friday it had agreed to buy Servac Inc and Servac International Inc, a Bahamian corporation, for 3,358,840 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Servac, a commercial fishing business, has assets of about $14 million and posted net sales of about $2.2 million last year, Ira Food said in a statement.</p>
